  <h2><span class="n">1</span>Overview</h2>
  <p>TechX: Bare Metal is a free one-day event at UCF on computer architecture and low-level programming, hosted by IEEE Computer Society at UCF as part of IEEE CS SYP TechX. The day has talks, panels, workshops and Nano Mentoring.</p>

