  <h2><span class="n">4</span>Nano Mentoring</h2>
  <p>Students meet one-on-one with mentors from industry and research. Mentoring runs for about three hours during the event, in person at UCF.</p>

  <h2><span class="n">5</span>About TechX</h2>
  <p>TechX is an event series from the IEEE Computer Society's Students and Young Professionals (SYP) program. Student chapters host their own TechX events. More on the <a href="{{ t.links.syp }}">IEEE CS SYP site</a>. Questions go to <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:{{ t.email }}">{{ t.email }}</a><!--/email_off-->.</p>
